<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<section xml:id="expansions-like-factors">
<title>Like Factors</title>
<p>Multiply the two binomials, collecting like terms when necessary. The exercises progress through signs, coefficient patterns, repeated brackets and squares. Reveal only the final answer after attempting each question.</p>
<exercise xml:id="expansions-like-factors-q001"><statement><p><m>\begin{array}{r}x+2\\[3pt]x+5\\[-1pt]\hline\end{array}</m></p></statement><answer><p><m>x^{2}+7x+10</m></p></answer></exercise>
<exercise xml:id="expansions-like-factors-q002"><statement><p><m>\begin{array}{r}3x+1\\[3pt]5x+1\\[-1pt]\hline\end{array}</m></p></statement><answer><p><m>15x^{2}+8x+1</m></p></answer></exercise>
<exercise xml:id="expansions-like-factors-q003"><statement><p><m>\begin{array}{r}x-3\\[3pt]x-7\\[-1pt]\hline\end{array}</m></p></statement><answer><p><m>x^{2}-10x+21</m></p></answer></exercise>
<exercise xml:id="expansions-like-factors-q004"><statement><p><m>\begin{array}{r}2x-1\\[3pt]5x-1\\[-1pt]\hline\end{array}</m></p></statement><answer><p><m>10x^{2}-7x+1</m></p></answer></exercise>
<exercise xml:id="expansions-like-factors-q005"><statement><p><m>\begin{array}{r}2x+3\\[3pt]2x+3\\[-1pt]\hline\end{array}</m></p></statement><answer><p><m>4x^{2}+12x+9</m></p></answer></exercise>
